What should you do?
Enable adaptive application controls in Microsoft Defender for Cloud and create an allowlist that includes the Remote Desktop Connection application.
説明
This answer is incorrect. Adaptive application controls in Microsoft Defender for Cloud are used to create allowlists of approved applications that can run on a VM, helping to block malware and unauthorized software execution. They do not manage network port access or RDP connectivity.
