Just-in-time (JIT) VM access in Microsoft Defender for Cloud is purpose-built to lock down management ports like RDP and SSH by default while allowing temporary, approved, and automatically time-limited access when needed. This satisfies both the security requirement (default deny) and the operational requirement (minimal manual effort), making Option 1 the best solution compared to Conditional Access, application controls, or manual NSG management.
